# Copy to .env (gitignored). modlobby-cli and a dev run of the app load it at startup; real environment variables win.
# Desktop app only. An installed app has no .env, so set it in the real environment there.
# Unset means on in a release and off in a `tauri dev` run; 0, false, off or no skips the startup
# update check and refuses the on-demand one, anything else allows both (e.g. 1 to test updating from dev).
# MODLOBBY_AUTO_UPDATE=0
